通费。</span></p><p><span>(三) 入营同学须全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者将取消营员资格，并自行承担所有费用。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/GNdh29QiaqdGHQgSnwiaQGEibugUFgmA2icMxhrxMGKOIia6tKU5kKQAav0SZgicK1icErJ1qWBbAM7iaRQ1Yly9PMucdsWrygvdR4tFiaIyFJL0icZ2w/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><strong><span>08</span></strong></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/GNdh29QiaqdE5SFeZbglQpTeZDtl4j8tvnXBMicVdjKUEgNmpibGYiaMbw7CXbxcuMNjtJWqA4lFib5bpDdO3QIkYF3axt0t5ibbsvsvPzyyfBmjk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><span><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/GNdh29QiaqdGTF1zF9ib6C3SdLDz6HsPTOaLoNN6OFjDjWV6WAdEyb1WulgOMTbUAibmjiasialCh5iapapibQcyRM0kbM0gyJ13VfOyDVuaKvEwdU/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>联系人：张老师</span></p><p><span>联系电话：0756-3683946</span></p><p><span>邮箱：91122013066@bnu.edu.cn</span></p><p><span>地址：广东省珠海市香洲区唐家湾金凤路18号</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/Ig2oaAmzSJdRfYPBiaSsF40CCtRf3ams09tTWW9Cic3IoFxCHJWOD98YsmS4V87ktdoTbRyoeciaVvGPm0mCDyFOWx5dEHRCluXJnDuUMOQibbA/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>学院官网</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/Ig2oaAmzSJfdHY69zhd9TUa2CkzZZDXa1n2IKna1FnETkiaGcDNXqV1SdWn66Jv3LVpPxKicxQeeslkaFbXlQqjqh5ngqJ6NsF36cdYV7kKXk/640?wx_fmt=png\"/></section></section><section><p><span>学院微信公众号</span></